== Section 18 __NOEDITSECTION__ ==
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-section18>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
<blockquote>17. Sappers<br>
The Sappers of Strombiu were no more than a bunch of renegade miners, who, frustrated by the thinly-veiled exploitation of the Chabuti by the Unity, decided to turn on their own government. The Ephors were renowned for their corruption, and had been selling off Chabuti land to Kioki consortia, land that was being heavily mined to fuel Kioki's war with Sabor. The Sappers got their revenge by sabotaging mining facilities with their explosive charges. When Chabuti fell, they took their explosives ship-to-ship instead, swinging their way aboard with their fireaxes. Though they naively sided with the Saborians (as if they were any better) in the war, I still regard them among the bravest.</blockquote>
</div>
</div>
<br>

